    364  39d6							; ------------------------------------------------------------ SysEx: a patch from Chip Lab (v0.20)
    365  39d6							; (v0.23: F0 7D 46 43 02 m F7 sets the chips on / off: DevicesReceived)
    366  39d6							; F0 7D 46 43 01 PATCH_SIZE, then the patch (PATCH_SIZE bytes, the live patch's layout:
    367  39d6							; tools/gen_patches.py) as two 4-bit halves each, high first, then F7. It
    368  39d6							; arrives in sxBuf; only a complete one goes into the live patch, which then
    369  39d6							; sounds at once (like choosing a sound). Anything else is ignored.
    370  39d6		       00 05	   SX_HEAD    equ	5
    371  39d6		       00 cf	   SX_LEN     equ	SX_HEAD + PATCH_SIZE * 2
