    211  3bfa							; OFF. VIBRATO or GLIDE held turns on what's off (the ADVANCED SOUND values;
    212  3bfa							; a held VIBRATO has no delay); TAPE WOBBLE held: a deep slow vibrato, each
    213  3bfa							; voice its own phase; WIDE held: the detune about twice as wide.
